OPENSSL LICENSING NOTE
----------------------

Klin 4.0.0 and later require OpenSSL 3.0 or newer for HTTPS, encrypted pages
and client-side sessions. OpenSSL 3 is distributed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0 (https://www.openssl.org/source/license.html), which can be
combined with Klin's BSD-style license (see LICENSE). No special linking
exception is needed.

If you distribute Klin binaries together with OpenSSL, follow the Apache
License 2.0 terms for OpenSSL, including its notice requirements.

From 2006 until KLone 3.1.0, KLone was licensed under the GNU GPL with an
exception permitting linking with OpenSSL, and that exception was kept in this
file. KLone 3.1.0 moved to the BSD-style license in LICENSE, so the exception
is no longer needed and has been removed.
